id: download-list
section: Media and sound
item: A finished download stands in the card's downloads panel (the history button's panel, its Downloads tab, by finger) and its bytes are on the device under /media/internal/downloads
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-long-static.html
kit: cavekit-device-build.md R4
calibrate 'sel:#content p'
inject url data:application/octet-stream;base64,SGVsbG8gZnJvbSBKaWhhZAo=
wait line 'jihad-dl.*finished' 30
expect file '/media/internal/downloads/jihad-download*' 'Hello from Jihad'
sample page 0,100,756,960
wait differs 0,100,756,960 page 8
chrome dialog-ok
wait still 0,100,756,960 5
sample page2 0,100,756,960
chrome history
wait differs 0,100,756,960 page2 5
wait still 0,100,756,960 4
shoot panel
sample list 450,80,768,400
chrome downloads-tab
wait differs 450,80,768,400 list 5
wait still 450,80,768,400 4
enyo: wait content 460,90,760,300 5
mochi: wait content 460,90,760,300 5
mojo: wait content 10,90,400,300 5
shoot downloads
